<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>JSN - ServiceNow CLI</title>
    
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg: #121212;
            --fg: #bebebe;
            --accent: #ffc107;
            --accent-dim: #e68e0d;
            --muted: #8a8a8d;
            --border: #333333;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--fg);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
        }

        .cursor {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 12px;
            height: 1.2em;
            background: var(--accent);
            animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
            vertical-align: text-bottom;
            margin-left: 2px;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* Install */
        .install {
            background: var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #444;
        }

        .install code {
            color: var(--accent);
            flex: 1;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--muted);
            color: var(--fg);
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .copy-btn:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Demo */
        .demo {
            margin: 3rem 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: #1e1e1e;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .demo .prompt { color: var(--accent); }
        .demo .output { color: var(--muted); }
        .demo .heading { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 1rem; }

        /* Expandable demo panels */
        details.demo-item {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #1e1e1e;
            margin: 0.75rem 0;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        }

        details.demo-item summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            user-select: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        details.demo-item summary .demo-cmd {
            flex: 1;
        }

        details.demo-item summary:hover .demo-cmd {
            color: #fff;
        }

        details.demo-item[open] summary .demo-cmd {
            color: #fff;
        }

        details.demo-item .output {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        details.demo-item .output pre {
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Features */
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.03);
        }

        .feature h3 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
        }

        .feature p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Code examples */
        .code-block {
            background: var(--border);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .code-block .comment {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .code-block .cmd {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .github-link {
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .github-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 1.75rem;
            }
            .install {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
                gap: 0.75rem;
            }
            .install code {
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                word-break: break-all;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="hero">
            <h1>Agent-first, agent-native<span class="cursor"></span></h1>
            <p class="tagline">The ServiceNow REST API, plus the context that matters.<br>Catalog variables, flow subflows, related records. Works standalone or with any AI agent.</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">
                <a href="https://github.com/jacebenson/jsn" style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem; border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 6px;">
                    <svg height="18" width="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor">
                        <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/>
                    </svg>
                    View on GitHub
                </a>
            </p>
            
            <div class="install">
                <code>npm install -g @jacebenson/jsn</code>
                <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyNpmInstall()">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: -1rem;">
                <span style="color: var(--muted);">Cross-platform · Works on Windows, macOS, Linux · Requires Node.js</span>
            </p>



            <div style="background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: left;">
            <strong style="color: var(--accent);">Requirements</strong>
            <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8;">
                <li><strong>Node.js</strong> required — that is the only runtime dependency</li>
                <li><strong>Install:</strong> <code style="color: var(--accent);">npm install -g @jacebenson/jsn</code> — works on Windows, macOS, Linux</li>
                <li><strong>AI Agents:</strong> <code style="color: var(--accent);">jsn skill install</code> after auth</li>
            </ul>
            </div>

            <details style="margin-top: 0.75rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer;">
                <summary style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem;">Don't have Node.js?</summary>
                <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                    Install Node.js and npm from the official site:<br>
                    <a href="https://nodejs.org" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent);">nodejs.org</a>
                </p>
                <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6;">
                    Or use a version manager:<br>
                    <code style="font-size: 0.8rem;">brew install node</code> (macOS) ·
                    <code style="font-size: 0.8rem;">sudo apt install nodejs npm</code> (Ubuntu/Debian) ·
                    <a href="https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent);">nvm</a> (all platforms)
                </p>
            </details>
        </header>

        <h2 style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace; text-align: center;">⏎  What it looks like</h2>

        <div class="demo" id="demo">
            <details class="demo-item">
                <summary><span class="demo-cmd">$ jsn incidents list --limit 4</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyDemo(this, 'jsn incidents list --limit 4')">Copy</button></summary>
                <div class="output"><pre>4 incident(s)


number          short_description                                 priority        state       assigned_to
--------------  ------------------------------------------------  --------------  ----------  ---------------
INC0000014      Missing my home directory test-1                  1 - Critical    Closed      Bud Richman
INC0000601      The USB port on my PC stopped working             5 - Planning    Closed
INC0009004      Defect tracking tool is down.                     3 - Moderate    Closed
INC0000005      CPU load high for over 10 minutes                 1 - Critical    Closed      Bud Richman

→ create: jsn inc create --description "..." — Create a new incidents
→ filter: jsn inc list --query "priority=1" — Filter: critical only
→ next: jsn inc list --limit 4 --offset 4 — Next page (offset 4)</pre></div>
            </details>

            <details class="demo-item">
                <summary><span class="demo-cmd">$ jsn requests show RITM0010001</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyDemo(this, 'jsn requests show RITM0010001')">Copy</button></summary>
                <div class="output"><pre>Request RITM0010001


RITM0010001 (Requested Item)

─ Core ─
  number:  RITM0010001
  sys_id:  02dedb44839e8b10f7bfc670ceaad36c
  state:  Open
  active:  true
  short_description:  Submit a nulledge knowledge speaking session
  priority:  4 - Low
  opened_by:  System Administrator
  opened_at:  2026-07-20 18:47:11

─ Catalog Variables ─
  Topic:  Moveworks!  What is Slate?  He can tell you!
  Speaker:  Teo


→ update: jsn req update RITM0010001 --data '{...}' — Update this request
→ list: jsn req list — Back to all requests</pre></div>
            </details>

            <details class="demo-item">
                <summary><span class="demo-cmd">$ jsn flows show "Service Catalog item request"</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyDemo(this, 'jsn flows show \"Service Catalog item request\"')">Copy</button></summary>
                <div class="output"><pre>Flow: Service Catalog item request

  Status: Active | Version: 2

▶ TRIGGER
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Name: Service Catalog
  Type: Service Catalog

⚡ FLOW STRUCTURE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
1. ↪ Requested Item Manager Approval
   1. Ask For Approval
     Record: {{subflow.requested_item}}
     Table: Requested Item
     Approval Field: approval
     Rules: ApprovesAnyU[{{subflow.requested_item.requested_for.manager}}]OrRejectsAnyU[{{subflow.requested_item.requested_for.manager}}]
   2. If: Manager Apporval is Rejected
