            </details>

            <details class="demo-item">
                <summary><span class="demo-cmd">$ jsn flows show "Major Incident Playbook - Create a Problem from Incident"</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyDemo(this, 'jsn flows show \"Major Incident Playbook - Create a Problem from Incident\"')">Copy</button></summary>
                <div class="output"><pre>Flow: Major Incident Playbook - Create a Problem from Incident

  Status: Active | Version: 2

▶ SUBFLOW
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Inputs (4)
    • Incident: reference
    • Close Conditions: condition_string
    • Cancel Conditions: condition_string
    • Skip Conditions: condition_string

  Outputs (2)
    • Flow Data Record: reference
    • Problem: reference

⚡ FLOW STRUCTURE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
1. Create Flow Data
    Definition: Manual Activity
    Wait for user input: No
    State: In Progress
2. ↪ Major Incident Playbook - Manage Flow Data Record
   1. If: Flow Data Record is Complete or Skipped
     2. End
   3. Else
